@@ -2513,3 +2513,38 @@ items.waterskin.desc_water=Right now the waterskin just contains some plain drin
 items.waterskin.desc_heal=The waterskin is currently being used to store healing water. The more full the waterskin is, the more you will be instantly healed when drinking from it. You will only drink as much as you need.
 items.waterskin.desc_full=The full waterskin seems to radiate energy, perhaps it can be used to bless another survival item?
 items.waterskin.discover_hint=One of the heroes starts with this item.
+
+
+# Werewolf mod
+items.weapon.melee.claws.name=claws
+items.weapon.melee.claws.desc=A permanent body weapon. Every 50 eligible kills grant +1 level (+1 minimum, +3 maximum damage). Every +2 claw levels add 1 maximum Heart-piercing charge, without a growth cap. Claws cannot be removed, normally upgraded, transmuted or normally enchanted. Whetstones replace enchantments without changing growth.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.ac_heart_pierce=Heart-piercing
+items.weapon.melee.claws.ac_pounce=Pounce
+items.weapon.melee.claws.heart_prompt=Select an enemy within claw reach
+items.weapon.melee.claws.pounce_prompt=Select an enemy or a visible landing cell
+items.weapon.melee.claws.no_charge=Not enough charge.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.invalid_target=That target is out of reach or the path is blocked.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.charge_info=Heart-piercing charge: %s. Starts with a maximum of 3; every +2 claw levels add 1 fully charged slot. Spend 1 charge to add +1–3 damage and bleeding to a normal attack. Charges regenerate over time.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.kills_info=Eligible kills: _%d_. Summoned creatures do not count. Health and claw growth have no cap.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.pounce_info=Pounce charge: %s. Cost 1; regenerates 1 charge per 30 turns. When ready, use the on-screen Pounce action button and select an enemy or landing cell.
+items.clawwhetstone.name=claw whetstone
+items.clawwhetstone.desc=Randomly gives claws an existing normal weapon enchantment other than the current one, preserving growth. Craft with 3 refined iron and 6 alchemy energy, or earn one per 100 eligible kills.
+items.clawwhetstone.ac_apply=Sharpen
+items.clawwhetstone.prompt=Select your claws
+items.clawwhetstone.applied=Your claws gain a new enchantment.
+items.ironscraps.name=iron powder
+items.ironscraps.desc=Material from dismantling ordinary weapons: one per weapon tier, plus one per two positive upgrades. Place one unit in each of the three alchemy slots to make one refined iron, at no energy cost.
+items.kindofweapon.ac_dismantle=Dismantle
+items.kindofweapon.dismantled=You received %d iron powder.
+items.kindofweapon.claws_only=A werewolf fights only with claws.
+items.food.food.ac_open=Open
+items.food.food.opened=The ration contained %d pieces of raw meat.
+items.food.food.cannot_eat=Open the ration to take out its meat.
+items.food.food.werewolf_desc=Werewolves cannot eat this ration directly. Open it in one turn for 1 or 2 raw meats, with equal probability.
+items.food.pasty.werewolf_desc=A werewolf can eat this, but it restores only one hunger band (150). It uses the same five-way raw-meat roll: burning, rooting, poison, slow, or no side effect. Fire and freezing do not make it safe.
+items.food.pasty.meat_portion=You found and ate the meat filling.
+items.food.mysterymeat.werewolf_desc=Fresh meat. Werewolves suffer no raw-meat side effects and eat it in one turn.
+items.armor.werewolfarmor.name=werewolf armor
+items.armor.werewolfarmor.desc=Royal armor shaped for a hunter. It fuels Beast Rampage. The werewolf's normal armor penalty remains in effect.
+items.refinediron.desc=Three iron powder refined through alchemy. Place one in each of the three alchemy slots and spend 6 energy to make one claw whetstone.
+items.refinediron.name=refined iron
diff --git a/core/src/main/assets/messages/items/items_ko.properties b/core/src/main/assets/messages/items/items_ko.properties
index 662bb72..ff4f847 100644
--- a/core/src/main/assets/messages/items/items_ko.properties
+++ b/core/src/main/assets/messages/items/items_ko.properties
@@ -2512,3 +2512,38 @@ items.waterskin.desc_water=이 가죽 물통에는 약간의 식수밖에 남아
 items.waterskin.desc_heal=가죽 물통에 회복 효과가 있는 물을 담았습니다. 가죽 물통에 담긴 물의 양이 많을수록, 마실 때 즉시 회복하는 체력 역시 증가합니다. 항상 당신이 필요한 만큼의 물만 소모합니다.
 items.waterskin.desc_full=가득 찬 가죽 물통이 에너지를 내뿜고 있는 것 같습니다. 아마 다른 생존 아이템을 축복하는 데 사용할 수 있지 않을까요?
 items.waterskin.discover_hint=특정 영웅이 이 아이템을 가지고 시작합니다.
+
+
+# Werewolf mod
+items.weapon.melee.claws.name=발톱
+items.weapon.melee.claws.desc=몸의 일부인 전용 무기입니다. 50킬마다 +1 강화(최소 피해 +1, 최대 피해 +3)를 얻습니다. 강화 수치 +2마다 심장찌르기의 최대 충전이 1 증가하며 성장 상한은 없습니다. 해제·일반 강화·변환·일반 마법부여가 불가능합니다. 발톱 숫돌은 강화 수치를 유지하며 인챈트를 교체합니다.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.ac_heart_pierce=심장찌르기
+items.weapon.melee.claws.ac_pounce=달려들기
+items.weapon.melee.claws.heart_prompt=발톱이 닿는 적을 선택하세요
+items.weapon.melee.claws.pounce_prompt=적 또는 시야 안의 도착 지점을 선택하세요
+items.weapon.melee.claws.no_charge=충전량이 부족합니다.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.invalid_target=대상이 사거리 밖이거나 경로가 막혀 있습니다.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.charge_info=심장찌르기 충전: %s. 기본 최대 3, 발톱 강화 +2마다 최대 충전 +1. 새로 늘어난 충전은 즉시 채워집니다. 1 충전으로 일반 공격에 +1~3 피해와 출혈을 더합니다. 시간이 지나면 자연 충전됩니다.
+items.weapon.melee.claws.kills_info=누적 성장 처치: _%d_. 소환수 처치는 제외됩니다. 육체와 발톱 성장에는 상한이 없습니다.
